<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP half year net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP half year net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to November 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit (billion)	 1.335 vs 1.513</p>
<p>    Net after abnormals		    790 vs 876</p>
<p>NOTE: The Broken Hill Proprietary Co Ltd is a steel, minerals and petroleum group. The company announced an interim dividend of 25 cents for the six months to November 30 with the first quarter results on September 20.  </p>
<p>    Sales (billion)		    10.159 vs 9.193</p>
<p>    Other income			    958 vs 176</p>
<p>    Shr (incl abnormals) (cents)     48.5 vs 54.8</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		profit  107 vs 65 profit</p>
<p>    Tax					 614 vs 502</p>
<p>    Interest				  301 vs 179</p>
<p>Depreciation 963 vs 826</p>
</text>
